<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Build a dinosaur" id="0017081e" height="400" width="556" hasaudio="0" hascredits="0" lang="E" basecontroltype="DragDrop" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="dragdrop" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide><toptext textstyleid="1"><text>&lt;html&gt;Arrastra los huesos del dinosaurio al lugar que les corresponde.&lt;/html&gt;</text></toptext><image>0017081e_stage.swf</image><bgimage>DDGv_standard_bg.swf</bgimage><imagerefid/><items><item id="0" seq="1" zindex="1" sequence="1"><image inbucketwidth="34" inbucketheight="36" onstagewidth="68" onstageheight="73" popwidth="68" popheight="73" onstagex="291" onstagey="77" baseheight="73" basewidth="68" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="50">Verte_cerv.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>291</x><y>120</y></point><point><x>292</x><y>149</y></point><point><x>306</x><y>152</y></point><point><x>358</x><y>90</y></point><point><x>358</x><y>72</y></point><point><x>347</x><y>69</y></point><point><x>291</x><y>120</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Vértebras cervicales</tooltext><solvedtooltext>&lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenía un cuello largo y flexible formado por 10 vértebras cervicales.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="1" seq="1" zindex="2" sequence="2"><image inbucketwidth="42" inbucketheight="25" onstagewidth="84" onstageheight="51" popwidth="84" popheight="51" onstagex="217" onstagey="120" baseheight="51" basewidth="84" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="50">Verte_dors.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>217</x><y>121</y></point><point><x>211</x><y>131</y></point><point><x>238</x><y>173</y></point><point><x>306</x><y>163</y></point><point><x>293</x><y>115</y></point><point><x>217</x><y>121</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Vértebras dorsales</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Las 13 vértebras dorsales forman el cuerpo corto y delgado de &lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt;.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="2" seq="1" zindex="3" sequence="3"><image inbucketwidth="81" inbucketheight="34" onstagewidth="162" onstageheight="68" popwidth="162" popheight="68" onstagex="14" onstagey="87" baseheight="68" basewidth="162" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="50">Verte_caud.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>76</x><y>77</y></point><point><x>20</x><y>78</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>111</y></point><point><x>13</x><y>134</y></point><point><x>84</x><y>163</y></point><point><x>168</x><y>164</y></point><point><x>176</x><y>108</y></point><point><x>103</x><y>117</y></point><point><x>76</x><y>77</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Vértebras caudales</tooltext><solvedtooltext>&lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenía al menos 30 vértebras caudales, que formaban la cola. Probablemente la cola rígida le servía de contrapeso durante la carrera.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="3" seq="1" zindex="4" sequence="4"><image inbucketwidth="42" inbucketheight="26" onstagewidth="42" onstageheight="26" popwidth="42" popheight="26" onstagex="356" onstagey="77" baseheight="26" basewidth="42" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">Craneo.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>345</x><y>74</y></point><point><x>349</x><y>107</y></point><point><x>392</x><y>107</y></point><point><x>400</x><y>78</y></point><point><x>354</x><y>71</y></point><point><x>345</x><y>74</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Cráneo</tooltext><solvedtooltext>&lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenía la cabeza larga y estrecha. Tenía dientes curvos y aserrados y se alimentaba de animales pequeños, como insectos, ranas, caracoles y lagartos.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="4" seq="1" zindex="5" sequence="5"><image inbucketwidth="32" inbucketheight="19" onstagewidth="32" onstageheight="19" popwidth="30" popheight="18" onstagex="263" onstagey="233" baseheight="19" basewidth="32" pctstage="100" pctpop="96.4" pctbucket="100">Pie_right.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>261</x><y>225</y></point><point><x>255</x><y>249</y></point><point><x>294</x><y>257</y></point><point><x>301</x><y>229</y></point><point><x>261</x><y>225</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Pie</tooltext><solvedtooltext>&lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenía los pies alargados, característicos de los dinosaurios rápidos. Eran similares a las patas de las aves, con tres dedos terminados en garra en cada pata.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="5" seq="1" zindex="6" sequence="6"><image inbucketwidth="24" inbucketheight="25" onstagewidth="24" onstageheight="25" popwidth="24" popheight="25" onstagex="158" onstagey="245" baseheight="25" basewidth="24" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">Pie_left.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>154</x><y>241</y></point><point><x>152</x><y>257</y></point><point><x>156</x><y>276</y></point><point><x>187</x><y>274</y></point><point><x>184</x><y>242</y></point><point><x>154</x><y>241</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Pie</tooltext><solvedtooltext>&lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenía los pies alargados, característicos de los dinosaurios rápidos. Eran similares a las patas de las aves, con tres dedos terminados en garra en cada pata.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="6" seq="1" zindex="7" sequence="7"><image inbucketwidth="59" inbucketheight="96" onstagewidth="59" onstageheight="96" popwidth="59" popheight="96" onstagex="205" onstagey="141" baseheight="96" basewidth="59" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">Ext_post_right.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>195</x><y>135</y></point><point><x>196</x><y>151</y></point><point><x>221</x><y>174</y></point><point><x>226</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>265</x><y>241</y></point><point><x>265</x><y>224</y></point><point><x>244</x><y>206</y></point><point><x>247</x><y>169</y></point><point><x>221</x><y>140</y></point><point><x>199</x><y>133</y></point><point><x>195</x><y>135</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Extremidad posterior</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los huesos de las extremidades posteriores son el fémur, la tibia y el peroné. La tibia y el peroné son más largos que el fémur. &lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; corría ágilmente en persecución de sus presas, valiéndose de las patas traseras.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="7" seq="1" zindex="8" sequence="8"><image inbucketwidth="29" inbucketheight="54" onstagewidth="59" onstageheight="108" popwidth="59" popheight="108" onstagex="161" onstagey="139" baseheight="108" basewidth="59" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="50">Ext_post_left.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>180</x><y>136</y></point><point><x>203</x><y>173</y></point><point><x>147</x><y>242</y></point><point><x>163</x><y>253</y></point><point><x>177</x><y>249</y></point><point><x>188</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>226</x><y>184</y></point><point><x>206</x><y>135</y></point><point><x>180</x><y>136</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Extremidad posterior</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los huesos de las extremidades posteriores son el fémur, la tibia y el peroné. La tibia y el peroné son más largos que el fémur. &lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; corría ágilmente en persecución de sus presas, valiéndose de las patas traseras.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="8" seq="1" zindex="9" sequence="9"><image inbucketwidth="32" inbucketheight="39" onstagewidth="32" onstageheight="39" popwidth="32" popheight="39" onstagex="297" onstagey="148" baseheight="39" basewidth="32" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">Ext_ant_right.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>294</x><y>149</y></point><point><x>296</x><y>172</y></point><point><x>302</x><y>182</y></point><point><x>328</x><y>190</y></point><point><x>333</x><y>181</y></point><point><x>311</x><y>168</y></point><point><x>305</x><y>145</y></point><point><x>294</x><y>149</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Extremidad anterior</tooltext><solvedtooltext>&lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenía las extremidades anteriores muy cortas, formadas por los huesos húmero, radio y cúbito. </solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="9" seq="1" zindex="10" sequence="10"><image inbucketwidth="15" inbucketheight="38" onstagewidth="15" onstageheight="38" popwidth="15" popheight="38" onstagex="281" onstagey="154" baseheight="38" basewidth="15" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">Ext_ant_left.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>291</x><y>149</y></point><point><x>280</x><y>165</y></point><point><x>278</x><y>186</y></point><point><x>286</x><y>197</y></point><point><x>299</x><y>189</y></point><point><x>295</x><y>175</y></point><point><x>303</x><y>153</y></point><point><x>291</x><y>149</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Extremidad anterior</tooltext><solvedtooltext>&lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenía las extremidades anteriores muy cortas, formadas por los huesos húmero, radio y cúbito.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="10" seq="1" zindex="11" sequence="11"><image inbucketwidth="19" inbucketheight="17" onstagewidth="19" onstageheight="17" popwidth="19" popheight="17" onstagex="329" onstagey="185" baseheight="17" basewidth="19" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">mano_right.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>327</x><y>186</y></point><point><x>327</x><y>194</y></point><point><x>338</x><y>206</y></point><point><x>353</x><y>202</y></point><point><x>353</x><y>182</y></point><point><x>334</x><y>177</y></point><point><x>328</x><y>188</y></point><point><x>327</x><y>186</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Mano</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Las manos de &lt;i&gt;Compsognathus&lt;/i&gt; tenían dos dedos terminados en garras, que utilizaban para agarrar a sus presas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="11" seq="1" zindex="12" sequence="12"><image inbucketwidth="16" inbucketheight="22" onstagewidth="16" onstageheight="22" popwidth="16" popheight="22" onstagex="291" onstagey="191" baseheight="22" basewidth="16" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">mano_left.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>291</x><y>192</y></point><point><x>289</x><y>204</y></point><point><x>28